  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n4X3EsE.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&color=252a36&labelColor=5865F2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&color=252A36&labelColor=FF424D&logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&color=252a36&labelColor=1D9BF0&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitter&logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>關於：</strong><br>為<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">\"<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Mounts Legacy</a>\"</span>提供改進的材質。<br>靈感源自 Jappa 與 Boss Refreshed，但融入了我的個人風格，且對遊戲幀率（FPS）十分友好。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>龍的材質靈感來自<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/boss-refreshed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\"Boss Refreshed by lukidon\"</a></span> [可選材質包]。</li>\n<li>改進龍蛋的模型與材質。</li>\n<li>中世紀與原版風格！！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>希望你能喜歡。❤<br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qjW_AXqTmmM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"421\" width=\"421\"></iframe></span><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JEEgj1uIkEY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"421\" width=\"421\"></iframe></span><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;如果你喜歡我的像素藝術風格，也歡迎嘗試：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-brewing-guide-on\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's - 煉金指南 [原版]</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 深色模式</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-white-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - 白色模式</a><br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak<br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fantasy-ores-modded-by-cesarzorak\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fantasy Ores by CesarZorak</a>&nbsp;[模組化]</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4r5WLBc.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"300\"></a><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><strong>💝 致 Patreon 贊助者 💝</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><em>請記得，你可以在官方的 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala Creations Patreon</a> 上支持我們，那裡會提供即將推出的更新資訊，<br>這將幫助我們為你呈現最佳的品質。</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EjFOwtq.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"550\"></p>",
